  "help_title": "Help and Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
  "help_faq_header": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "help_q1": "1. How can I create a report?",
  "help_a1": "Click the 'Report Issue' button on the home page. Take a photo and wait for the AI to automatically determine the issue. Submit your report without entering extra descriptions.",
  "help_q2": "2. What if the AI selects the wrong category?",
  "help_a2": "On the submission screen, you can manually select the correct category using the 'Edit' option next to the AI-selected category. The system learns from this correction.",
  "help_q3": "3. How can I track my complaint status?",
  "help_a3": "By going to the 'My Complaint History' tab in the side menu, you can instantly track the status (New, In Progress, Completed) of all the reports you have sent.",
  "help_q4": "4. What is guest mode?",
  "help_a4": "It is a mode that allows temporary users to report basic issues.",
  "help_q5": "5. How does the voice reporting feature work?",
  "help_a5": "Designed especially for visually impaired or elderly users. Describe your problem audibly using the 'Voice Report' option.",
  "help_still_need_help": "Still need help?",
  "help_contact_desc": "You can reach out to us in writing for any other questions you may have.",
  "help_contact_btn": "View Contact Channels",

